SUMMARY:Trick or Treat in the Greenhouse
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a spooky adventure as we fill the Greenhouse with treats and tricks – double the fun at both locations! \n\n\n\n\nVisit us with your kids for a spooktacular fun and trick-or-treating in the beautiful greenhouse. Don’t miss out on the opportunity to enjoy the festive decorations and treats. This event includes a chance to spin the prize wheel\, a FREE kids craft\, and a scavenger hunt with opportunities to win extra prizes. It’s a perfect way to celebrate the season with family and friends. See you there! \nThis is a drop in event\, no need to register! \n 
