 Anticipated Average Speed: (14-16 mph)**\n\n**This is an Intermediate C Cl
 ass ride. The ride leader will ride at a pace to maintain an overall avera
 ge speed within the advertised range.**\n\n**This is intended to be a grou
 p ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do their
  best to keep the group together with occasional regroups and/or splitting
  into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.**\n\n**Please do not 
 join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If you excee
 d the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join 
 a faster group. If maintaining a 14-16 mph average is beyond your current 
 ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.**\n\n**Helmet
 s are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (sp
 are tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).**\n\n**To eliminate passing a
 round a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup R
