DESCRIPTION:Business & Career\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nRegistration will open a
 t 9:00 AM on Tuesday\, September 1st\, 2026.  Registering for the first we
 ek (October 20th\, 2026) will hold your place for all six weeks of the wor
 kshop. The Conestoga Toastmasters Club is conducting a free six-week works
 hop at the library called Youth Leadership.The Youth Leadership Program co
 nsists of six sessions helping those between the ages of 12 and 15 to deve
 lop their communication and leadership skills through practical experience
 . In the workshop\, young people will learn how to:Evaluate their own spea
 king abilityPrepare and deliver speechesGive impromptu talksControl their 
 voice\, vocabulary\, and gesturesGive constructive feedback and moreConest
 oga Toastmasters was founded in 1955 as a non-profit organization and are 
 committed to developing confident communicators and successful leaders who
  will positively influence the community.
