DESCRIPTION:Community\, Health & Wellness\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nUnderstand
 ing Medicare can be difficult. PA-MEDI is here to help! We provide free\, 
 unbiased help to Medicare beneficiaries in Pennsylvania. We can assist ind
 ividuals with:Eligibility & EnrollmentNotices of CostOriginal MedicareMedi
 gapMedicare AdvantagePrescription Drug (Part D) BenefitsSwitching & Compar
 ing PlansAppealsMedicare Savings ProgramsPlease call 717-299-7979 to set u
