DESCRIPTION:Health & Wellness\, STEM\, Children\n\nHave you ever wondered 
 how your heart beats? Or why is it so hard to taste when you have a stuffy
  nose? And what’s with that weird crust you get on the inside corner of 
 your eyes sometimes? Also\, why can’t I lick my elbow?!?! If so\, you ar
 e just the curious mind we are looking for to join in on our exciting expl
 oration of the human body! In this program\, homeschoolers will delve into
  learning about the human body through a combination of storytelling\, han
 ds-on activities and interactive stations! Young scientists will gain a de
 eper understanding of how their bodies work and why they are so incredible
 ! Ages 6-10.
