UID:e9c3f6194b74dfb901ba2d570853ae28@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Fundraiser\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nJoin the Friends of the Adams
 town Area Library at The Village Haus in Stoudtburg Village for an evening
  of delicious food and fun to benefit the library. Only 75 tickets will be
  sold for this dinner and auction complete with live auction\, raffles\, 5
