UID:a5a4bf0d1daf9c74b62c5032542a9872@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Adults\, Seniors\n\n🀄️️🌙 Join us for an eve
 ning of strategy\, skill\, and socializing! 🀄️🌙Whether you are a s
 easoned pro or a newcomer looking to practice\, come unwind and enjoy the 
 classic game of tiles in a friendly\, community-led atmosphere\, every Wed
 nesday from 5:30-7:45 PM in the MTPL's Morgan Center.Note: This is a self-
 directed community group. While no formal instructor is provided\, players
  of all levels are welcome to learn from one another.What to Bring:Sets an
 d racks (at least one per four players)Your current 2026 National Mah Jong
 g League cardA friendly\, patient attitude!Community Guidelines:Be Welcomi
 ng: We all started as beginners! Please be patient with those still learni
 ng to play.The "Rule of Five": If a fifth player joins your table\, we sug
 gest the "East Sits Out" rotation—the player in the East position rotate
 s out for one hand so everyone gets to play.Fair Play: Tables are availabl
 e on a first-come\, first-served basis. Please keep talk inclusive and the
  atmosphere kind.Evening Pace: To ensure everyone finishes smoothly before
  closing\, no new games should start after 7:25 PM.Registration is Require
 d for this event!This program is for adults ages +18.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/mahjong-after-dark-21002
 9
