UID:ce99af5e0aeab5a0856fa186fc57aa3d@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nCalling all sports romance fan
 s! Join us for Game Day Reads\, MTPL’s monthly book club dedicated entir
 ely to love on the field\, court\, and rink.This November\, we’re kickin
 g off the DC Stars series with Face Off by Chelsea Curto. When a fiery spo
 rts PR specialist and a brooding professional hockey player are forced to 
 work together\, sparks fly both on and off the ice. Sparks quickly turn to
  heat in this laugh-out-loud\, rivals-to-lovers story filled with plenty o
 f banter.Grab a copy\, jump into the lineup\, and join us for the discussi
 on!Copies are available for checkout digitally on Hoopla!
