 lts\, Seniors\n\nBest for adults and mature children 5+\, please register 
 every person in your group!Explore the stories\, mysteries\, and hidden ge
 ography of one of the world’s oldest rivers as it runs through Lancaster
  County. From lesser-known historical accounts to enduring local legends l
 ike the Susquehanna mermaid and albatwitch\, the presentation will highlig
 ht the people\, places\, and cultural stories connected to the mighty Susq
 uehanna and the communities along its banks. Adam will be selling copies o
 f his books to share proceeds with the Library as part of our Extra Give p
 rogramming.
