 aker workshop inspired by Adam Wallace’s bestselling children's book\, H
 ow to Catch a Turkey. Kids will step into the shoes of real structural eng
 ineers to design\, build\, and test their very own turkey traps using ever
 yday building materials. Recommended for ages 8-12! Registration is requir
 ed!🛠️ The Engineering MissionThe Story Setup: We will start with a re
 ading of How to Catch a Turkey to study the turkey's clever escape tactics
 .The Blueprint: Kids will brainstorm\, sketch\, and map out their trap con
 cepts on official design sheets.The Construction: Makers will use their en
 gineering supplies to bring their structures to life.The Field Test: We wi
 ll wrap up the program by testing every trap to see if it can successfully
  a paper turkey!
