DESCRIPTION:Join Chef Sophia Dickmyer at Zest Cooking School for a fun\, hands-on class dedicated to transforming holiday leftovers into something entirely new. Learn how to give familiar Thanksgiving favorites a creative makeover\, from flaky\, savory hand pies filled with turkey and cranberry to crispy mashed potato cakes and a cozy seasonal dessert. Along the way\, you’ll practice versatile techniques for working with pastry\, building flavor\, and making the most of what’s already in your refrigerator. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nTurkey\, Cranberry & Brie Puff Pastry Hand Pies\nCrispy Mashed Potato Cakes with Garlic-Herb Sour Cream\nThanksgiving Stuffing-Stuffed Mushrooms with Parmesan & Fresh Herbs\nPumpkin Bread Pudding with Salted Caramel Sauce
