BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Bird In Hand": "https://bird-in-hand.com/event/christmas-shopping-bus-tour/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bird_in_hand
X-SOURCE:Bird-in-Hand
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T123000
DTSTAMP:20260902T105944Z
CREATED:20260902T105514Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T105944Z
UID:10001069-1795856400-1795869000@bird-in-hand.com
SUMMARY:Christmas Shopping Bus Tour
DESCRIPTION:Give unique gifts from Lancaster County \nHere’s a really fun new way to wrap up your holiday gifting while getting to know some great shops in Bird-in-Hand and beyond. \nOn select Saturdays\, guests of our lodging properties will have an exclusive opportunity to board our Christmas Shopping Bus Tour\, with stops at businesses featuring Amish and Mennonite handcrafted home décor\, soaps\, candles\, gourmet foods\, baked and canned goods\, and other unique treasures that will simplify your gift giving and be sure to bring smiles and warm hearts to all those on your holiday shopping list. All guests will receive a special keepsake from our tour. \nThe excursion begins and ends at the Bird-in-Hand Family Inn\, where you’ll board our tour bus for a morning of shopping in our village\, Leola\, Intercourse and other Lancaster County towns. We’ll handle the driving and have you back at the Family Inn by early afternoon. \nThis special tour is limited to 14 guests per day and is available only on the Saturdays listed below. If you’re planning a stay with us on one of those weekends\, reserve your spot soon so you don’t miss out. \n$25 per person (13 and older)\n$15 per person (12 and under) \nDates: \n\nNovember 28\nDecember 5\nDecember 12\nDecember 19\n\nTime: \n\n9 a.m.–12:30 pm.\n\nPrepaid registration required: Call Central Reservations at (717) 768-8271 to reserve; minimum 24-hour notice required for cancellation.
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/christmas-shopping-bus-tour/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Family Inn
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/HolidayShoppingTour2.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Bird In Hand": "https://bird-in-hand.com/event/small-business-saturday/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bird_in_hand
X-SOURCE:Bird-in-Hand
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T170000
DTSTAMP:20261028T150321Z
CREATED:20261028T145959Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T150321Z
UID:10001082-1795856400-1795885200@bird-in-hand.com
SUMMARY:Small Business Saturday
DESCRIPTION:Small Business Saturday is a great day to shop Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village \nFor more than a decade\, Small Business Saturday has celebrated small businesses and their contributions to their communities. At Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village\, we celebrate entrepreneurship every day\, but this year on Small Business Saturday\, we’re doing something special. \nMeet the makers\, sample local food products and shop our carefully curated collection of locally made merchandise\, including one-of-a kind jewelry\, heirloom quality furniture and toys\, fashion accessories\, housewares and home décor\, and much more\, as well as a selection of locally produced gourmet treats that make welcome hostess gifts. \nYou can also enter to win a $50 Artisan Village gift certificate. \nIt’s shopping you can feel good about! \nDate: Saturday\, November 28 \nTime: 9 a.m. – 5 p.m.
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/small-business-saturday/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village\, 2705 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/SmallBusinessSaturdayHeader.jpg
END:VEVENT
