UID:a0b488292c06a75a17cd33af5547007c@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Fundraiser\, Everyone\n\nJoin us for a silent auction featurin
 g gift-ready pairings of books and bags. Creator of the brand Small Batch 
 Bags has designed a line of unique hand-crafted pieces that we have paired
  with books from every genre for a one-of-a kind gift-buying experience! S
