UID:0865654362945875ad583d66d6bd4365@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nSkip the mall and
  head to the kitchen! This December\, Cooks & Books is getting festive wit
 h Food Gifts from America’s Test Kitchen. We’re swapping the stress of
  holiday shopping for seasoned salts\, artisanal granolas\, DIY hot cocoa 
 mixes\, and more!Bring a prepared batch of your favorite food gift to shar
 e!Bonus Activity: Holiday Gift Swap! Bring samples of your edible gifts an
 d trade with fellow home cooks to build a customized gift bag! (Note: Plea
 se bring your own jars\, tins\, ribbons\, or containers to package up your
  swapped treats\, as packaging supplies are bring-your-own.)🍽️Cooks &
  Books is an opportunity for passionate home cooks to gather around the ta
 ble for conversation over delicious food inspired by a featured chef\, foo
 d blog\, or cookbook. Why not invite a friend to join you? The more\, the 
 merrier!Requirements: Attendees should be 14 years of age or older. Vegan 
 and vegetarian recipes are always welcome.Supplies: Please bring your own 
 serving utensils\, place setting\, to-go container\, and beverage.Cost: Th
 e event is free\, but reservations are required!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/cooks-books-handmade-hol
 iday-160165
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
