SUMMARY:2844 - International Holiday Table
DESCRIPTION:Join Chef Cat Alwine for a culinary journey with our International Holiday Table class! Explore festive dishes from around the globe as you learn to prepare a diverse holiday feast. Chef Cat will guide you through making delicious recipes that bring global traditions to your table. Perfect for adding an international twist to your holiday celebrations! \nHands on. Ages 16 and up.  \n\nPonche de Naviendo\nItalian Anginetti Cookies\nEthiopian Dorowat\nHawaiian Manapua
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2844-international-holiday-table/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 35 S. Willowdale drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festive,International Cuisine,Seasonal
