DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nWelcome to 
 your child's first classroom! We will read 3-4 books\, create an art proje
 ct and involve sensory each week. This program focuses on letter recogniti
 on\, reading comprehension\, and creating friendships in our community! Ag
