 g purpose than to use it to inspire a new generation of artists! Carlson K
 ids is a new grant-funded program that brings together a local art teacher
 \, some aspiring teen coaches\, and young future artists!  Students will d
 o art activities in similar styles to Charlie Carlson's work\, which inclu
 des watercolor\, collage\, cartooning\, and some experimental projects. Th
 is program will be offered on one Thursday afternoon and one Saturday afte
