  flashlight “fire.” Let’s chill out with stories of warmth\, kindnes
 s and personal triumphs. We’ll also explore fun and laid-back crafts and
  activities that help us practice relaxation and mindfulness. Together we
 ’ll learn simple tools for letting go of stress\, building kindness and 
 celebrating what makes us strong inside and out. Feel free to wear your pj
 s and bring a blanket and/or a stuffed animal! Ages 5-9.
